{
  "id": "ctSGWm",
  "name": "Àtrous Wavelet Denoising",
  "author": "Mathis",
  "description": "Denoising shadows and reflections using two modified Àtrous wavelet filters with temporal accumulation + TAA.\nNon-occluded diffuse indirect light is used and normals are calculated in screen space.\n\nUse the mouse to move the camera!",
